   "source": [
    "# APDS9960距离传感器的使用"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "接线：\n",
    "\n",
    "- APDS9960 VCC -- Rpi 3V3 (pin 1)\n",
    "- APDS9960 GND -- Rpi GND (pin 9)\n",
    "- APDS9960 SDA -- Rpi SDA (GPIO2, pin 3)\n",
    "- APDS9960 SCL -- Rpi SCL (GPIO3, pin 5)\n",
    "\n",
    "树莓派的针脚图可参考实验指导书或使用`pinout`命令查看。\n",
    "\n",
    "依赖包：`smbus`, `apds9960`\n",
    "\n",
    "运行前先通过`raspi-config`命令开启I2C接口。"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "首先进行初始化设置："
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 1,
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "# 本代码块为初始化代码，运行一次即可。多次运行可能报错，若报错可以点击 jupyter 界面中的 ⟳ 按钮重启 python 进程。"
    "import smbus\n",
    "import RPi.GPIO as GPIO\n",
    "from apds9960.const import *\n",
    "from apds9960 import APDS9960\n",
    "\n",
    "def intH(channel):\n",
    "    print(\"INTERRUPT\")\n",
    "\n",
    "port = 1\n",
    "bus = smbus.SMBus(port)\n",
    "apds = APDS9960(bus)\n",
    "GPIO.setmode(GPIO.BOARD)\n",
    "GPIO.setup(7, GPIO.IN)\n",
    "GPIO.add_event_detect(7, GPIO.FALLING, callback = intH)\n",
    "apds.setProximityIntLowThreshold(50)\n",
    "apds.enableProximitySensor()"
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "markdown",
   "metadata": {},
   "source": [
    "在运行下面这段代码的同时，试着用手靠近和远离传感器，观察输出值的变化："
